  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile, pca_n2000 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_019) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.639). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with a more advanced imagenet_vit_l image encoder and switching aggregation from avgpool to transformer, while retaining weighted fusion. This isolates the effect of the image encoder and aggregation method, which are critical design choices with potential for performance gains. It balances exploitation of the successful multimodal/multiprofile direction with exploration of stronger components."
}

